-- Housing costs (regulations 25 and 26).
-- 25. Arguments: rent payments, service charge payments, liability on a commercial basis, treated as liable under Part 1 of Schedule 2, Part 2 of Schedule 2 treats as not liable, treated under Part 1 of Schedule 3 as occupying, Part 2 of Schedule 3 treats as not occupying.
-- Rent payments, liability on a commercial basis, occupation.
#ASSERT `Do I meet the conditions for the housing costs element` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE
-- Service charge payments, treated as liable under Schedule 2.
#ASSERT `Do I meet the conditions for the housing costs element` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE
-- (2): the payments are neither rent nor service charge payments.
#ASSERT NOT (`Do I meet the conditions for the housing costs element` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- (3)(a): no liability on a commercial basis and none treated.
#ASSERT NOT (`Do I meet the conditions for the housing costs element` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- (3)(b): Part 2 of Schedule 2 treats the claimant as not liable.
#ASSERT NOT (`Do I meet the conditions for the housing costs element` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- (4)(a): not treated as occupying the accommodation as their home.
#ASSERT NOT (`Do I meet the conditions for the housing costs element` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- (4)(b): Part 2 of Schedule 3 treats the claimant as not occupying it.
#ASSERT NOT (`Do I meet the conditions for the housing costs element` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- 26(6). Arguments: the nation, a lease granted on payment of a premium (England and Wales), a joint-ownership agreement (Scotland), a right-to-purchase agreement (Scotland).
-- (6)(a): England, a lease granted on payment of a premium.
#ASSERT `Is my tenancy a shared ownership tenancy` England TRUE FALSE FALSE
-- (6)(a): Wales.
#ASSERT `Is my tenancy a shared ownership tenancy` Wales TRUE FALSE FALSE
-- A premium lease is the England and Wales form.
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my tenancy a shared ownership tenancy` Scotland TRUE FALSE FALSE)
-- (6)(b): Scotland, joint owners and the tenant is tenant in respect of the landlord's interest.
#ASSERT `Is my tenancy a shared ownership tenancy` Scotland FALSE TRUE FALSE
-- (6)(b): Scotland, a right to purchase.
#ASSERT `Is my tenancy a shared ownership tenancy` Scotland FALSE FALSE TRUE
-- The Scottish form in England.
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my tenancy a shared ownership tenancy` England FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- No such agreement.
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my tenancy a shared ownership tenancy` Scotland FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- 26(2) to (4). Arguments: I meet all the conditions in regulation 25, rent payments, service charge payments, shared ownership tenancy.
-- (2): rent payments.
#ASSERT `Which Schedule decides the amount of my housing costs element` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `Schedule 4 only`
-- (3): service charge payments.
#ASSERT `Which Schedule decides the amount of my housing costs element` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `Schedule 5 only`
-- (4): both paragraphs apply and a shared ownership tenancy.
#ASSERT `Which Schedule decides the amount of my housing costs element` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `both Schedules 4 and 5, for a shared ownership tenancy`
-- Both paragraphs apply, but (4) deals only with a shared ownership tenancy (fork F-26-OVERLAP).
#ASSERT `Which Schedule decides the amount of my housing costs element` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `not covered: both paragraphs (2) and (3) apply but the tenancy is not a shared ownership tenancy`
-- (1): only a claimant who meets all the conditions of regulation 25.
#ASSERT `Which Schedule decides the amount of my housing costs element` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `neither Schedule, because the claimant does not meet all the conditions of regulation 25`
-- Neither paragraph (2) nor (3) applies.
#ASSERT `Which Schedule decides the amount of my housing costs element` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not covered: neither paragraph (2) nor paragraph (3) applies`
-- 26(4). Arguments: the Schedules, the amount under Schedule 4, the amount under Schedule 5.
-- The amount under Schedule 4.
#ASSERT `How much is my housing costs element` `Schedule 4 only` 500 40 EQUALS JUST 500
-- The amount under Schedule 5.
#ASSERT `How much is my housing costs element` `Schedule 5 only` 500 40 EQUALS JUST 40
-- (4)(b): the aggregate.
#ASSERT `How much is my housing costs element` `both Schedules 4 and 5, for a shared ownership tenancy` 500 40 EQUALS JUST 540
-- No element is included.
#ASSERT `How much is my housing costs element` `neither Schedule, because the claimant does not meet all the conditions of regulation 25` 500 40 EQUALS NOTHING
-- The text does not say.
#ASSERT `How much is my housing costs element` `not covered: both paragraphs (2) and (3) apply but the tenancy is not a shared ownership tenancy` 500 40 EQUALS NOTHING
-- The text does not say.
#ASSERT `How much is my housing costs element` `not covered: neither paragraph (2) nor paragraph (3) applies` 500 40 EQUALS NOTHING
-- 26(5). Arguments: the Schedules, liable for service charge payments.
-- (5): a case to which (4) applies, with a liability for service charge payments.
#ASSERT `Is the amount for my service charge payments worked out under Schedule 4 because of my shared ownership tenancy` `both Schedules 4 and 5, for a shared ownership tenancy` TRUE
-- No liability for service charge payments.
#ASSERT NOT (`Is the amount for my service charge payments worked out under Schedule 4 because of my shared ownership tenancy` `both Schedules 4 and 5, for a shared ownership tenancy` FALSE)
-- Not a case to which (4) applies: (5) says nothing.
#ASSERT NOT (`Is the amount for my service charge payments worked out under Schedule 4 because of my shared ownership tenancy` `Schedule 5 only` TRUE)

