-- Extra for illness, disability and caring (regulations 27 to 30).
-- 27A(1), (1A), (2). Arguments: limited capability for work and work-related activity, entitled to an award that included the LCWRA element, the earliest day of such entitlement, a period of non-entitlement since, it began because the financial condition ceased to be met, the day it ceased, the last day of the period of non-entitlement, a circumstance in Schedule 5A.
-- (1): entitled before 6 April 2026, continuously since.
