-- 28(2), (3)(b). Arguments: previous award in the circumstances of (4), I applied, the day I applied, regulation 41(2) applies, the day my award commenced, the first day I provided evidence, (4)(a), (4)(b), the previous award included the LCWRA element, its relevant period begun but not ended, the day it would have ended.
